gitleaks detection ruleset
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

internal/scan/gitleaks.toml is the gitleaks default detection ruleset, used
verbatim by the `kryptic scan` command. It is compiled into the `kryptic` CLI
only - the daemon and the tray do not link it.

